            "text": "### Company Summary: Freshworks Inc.\n\n**Overview**\nFreshworks Inc. (NASDAQ: FRSH) is a global cloud-based Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) provider specializing in AI-first service software designed to uncomplicate business operations and deliver customer and employee experiences. \n\n**History & Leadership**\n* **Founded:** October 2010 in Chennai, India, originally named *Freshdesk*. Rebranded to Freshworks in 2017 and went public on NASDAQ in September 2021.\n* **Headquarters:** San Mateo, California, USA.\n* **Founders:** Girish Mathrubootham and Shan Krishnasamy.\n* **Leadership:** Dennis Woodside serves as Chief Executive Officer and President.\n\n**Key Products & Services**\nFreshworks builds AI-powered, easy-to-implement tools across Customer Experience (CX), IT Service Management (ITSM), and Customer Relationship Management (CRM):\n* **Freshdesk:** Cloud-based omnichannel customer support and ticketing software.\n* **Freshservice:** Modern ITSM and Enterprise Service Management solution to streamline internal IT operations, asset management, and employee service workflows.\n* **Freshchat:** Conversational AI platform for customer engagement across web, email, SMS, and messaging channels.\n* **Freshsales & Freshmarketer:** CRM and sales/marketing automation platforms designed to manage pipelines and close deals faster.\n* **Freddy AI:** Built-in generative and predictive AI engine embedded across products to automate repetitive tasks and enhance agent productivity.\n\n**Scale & Value Proposition**\n* **Mission:** Deliver \"enterprise capability without enterprise complexity\" by providing software that is easy to start, easy to use, and quick to return value.\n* **Global Footprint:** Serves over 70,000 customers worldwide with a workforce of over 5,000 employees operating across 13 locations globally (including the US, India, UK, Netherlands, Germany, and Australia)"
          },
          {
